Blargg Game Boy test ROMs — licensing / provenance
====================================================

These ROM binaries and accompanying suite notes under tests/fixtures/blargg/
are NOT licensed under the Graycart repository MIT license
(see the repository root LICENSE).

Author
------
Shay Green (“Blargg”) <gblargg@gmail.com>

Upstream distribution
---------------------
The copies vendored in this repository were obtained from the widely used
community mirror:

  https://github.com/retrio/gb-test-roms

That mirror’s top-level readme.txt states that these are Blargg’s Game Boy
hardware test ROMs, originally hosted at:

  http://blargg.parodius.com/gb-tests/

and later noted as:

  http://blargg.8bitalley.com/parodius/gb-tests/

License status
--------------
The retrio/gb-test-roms mirror does not ship an SPDX LICENSE file. Shay Green
distributed the ROMs (with source historically available) for emulator and
hardware testing. Graycart does not relicense these files; retain author
attribution and consult upstream if you redistribute them outside this tree.

Suite documentation retained in-tree (examples)
-----------------------------------------------
  cgb_sound/readme.txt  — Shay Green test documentation

See also tests/fixtures/README.md and tests/fixtures/blargg/README.md.
